{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026e6cfxhtmnJ1794953196.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：廣東沿岸風勢微弱。此外，位於廣東北部的一道冷鋒正逐漸向南移動，預料會在今日稍後橫過沿岸地區。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：大致多雲。日間短暫時間有陽光，最高氣溫約27度。吹微風，稍後北風增強及有一兩陣雨。晚上市區氣溫下降至最低約21度，新界再低兩三度。</p><p></p><p>展望：未來一兩日大致多雲，天氣顯著轉涼，星期五及星期六市區最低氣溫在15、16度左右，新界再低兩三度。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T23:22:20.508500+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T21:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T23:15:35.061440+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T23:15:35.061440+00:00","content_hash":"8c96f879ba40a8a69b3abd58ca2c81fbdfe67c9f6ce9adf272b72839519af084","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}